    <briefdescription>
<para>Information about the plugin required to load its passes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This struct defines the core interface for pass plugins and is supposed to be filled out by plugin implementors. LLVM-side users of a plugin are expected to use the <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_pass_plugin" kindref="compound">PassPlugin</ref></computeroutput> class below to interface with it. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
